    "title": "Bitcoin Faces 6-Year Moving Average Test Only Seen During FTX Collapse",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNl3YXLFOfk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pNl3YXLFOfk/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse-pNl3YXLFOfk.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Faces 6-Year Moving Average Test Only Seen During FTX Collapse</a></p>\n<p>Since 2016, the only time Bitcoin closed below its six-year moving average was the FTX crash.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Faces 6-Year Moving Average Test Only Seen During FTX Collapse</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNl3YXLFOfk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pNl3YXLFOfk/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse-pNl3YXLFOfk.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Faces 6-Year Moving Average Test Only Seen During FTX Collapse</a></p>\n<p>Since 2016, the only time Bitcoin closed below its six-year moving average was the FTX crash.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-faces-6-year-moving-average-test-only-seen-during-ftx-collapse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Faces 6-Year Moving Average Test Only Seen During FTX Collapse</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
