    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WqaLae4ARmI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WqaLae4ARmI/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe-WqaLae4ARmI.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe\" rel=\"nofollow\">“Escape Velocity” Coming for Bitcoin with Repeat of 2017 Cycle | Michaël van de Poppe</a></p>\n<p>The Fear &#38; Greed Index has sat in extreme fear, and Michaël van de Poppe says people are upset that Bitcoin has underperformed other assets.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe\" rel=\"nofollow\">“Escape Velocity” Coming for Bitcoin with Repeat of 2017 Cycle | Michaël van de Poppe</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WqaLae4ARmI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WqaLae4ARmI/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe-WqaLae4ARmI.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe\" rel=\"nofollow\">“Escape Velocity” Coming for Bitcoin with Repeat of 2017 Cycle | Michaël van de Poppe</a></p>\n<p>The Fear &#38; Greed Index has sat in extreme fear, and Michaël van de Poppe says people are upset that Bitcoin has underperformed other assets.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/escape-velocity-coming-for-bitcoin-with-repeat-of-2017-cycle-michael-van-de-poppe\" rel=\"nofollow\">“Escape Velocity” Coming for Bitcoin with Repeat of 2017 Cycle | Michaël van de Poppe</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
