    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HS5covt-oog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/HS5covt-oog/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/andre-dragosch-bitcoin-at-fire-sale-valuations-heading-into-fed-pivot-HS5covt-oog.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/andre-dragosch-bitcoin-at-fire-sale-valuations-heading-into-fed-pivot\" rel=\"nofollow\">André Dragosch: Bitcoin at “Fire Sale” Valuations Heading Into Fed Pivot</a></p>\n<p>André Dragosch says Fed language is already as hawkish as it was in 2022, and \"we are probably close to peak hawkishness.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/andre-dragosch-bitcoin-at-fire-sale-valuations-heading-into-fed-pivot\" rel=\"nofollow\">André Dragosch: Bitcoin at “Fire Sale” Valuations Heading Into Fed Pivot</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
